<h1>Sample page with attachments</h1>
<p>This fixture exercises the object macros a real Confluence page uses to reference the files attached to it. Converting it with <code>--format md</code> should turn every one of them into ordinary Markdown.</p>
<h2>An embedded image</h2>
<p><ac:image ac:align="center" ac:width="400"><ri:attachment ri:filename="diagram.png" ri:version-at-save="1" /></ac:image></p>
<h2>An image with a caption</h2>
<ac:image ac:align="center"><ri:attachment ri:filename="B-AROL-O logo.png" /><ac:caption><p>Figure 1: the <strong>project</strong> logo.</p></ac:caption></ac:image>
<h2>An image hosted somewhere else</h2>
<p><ac:image><ri:url ri:value="https://www.gnu.org/graphics/gplv3-127x51.png" /></ac:image></p>
<h2>A link to an attached file</h2>
<p>The full text is in <ac:link><ri:attachment ri:filename="specification.txt" /><ac:plain-text-link-body><![CDATA[the specification]]></ac:plain-text-link-body></ac:link>, attached to this page.</p>
<h2>A link to another page, which stays unresolved</h2>
<p>See also <ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title="Another page" /><ac:plain-text-link-body><![CDATA[Another page]]></ac:plain-text-link-body></ac:link>.</p>
<h2>Two images on one line</h2>
<p>Side by side: <ac:image><ri:attachment ri:filename="diagram.png" /></ac:image> <ac:image><ri:attachment ri:filename="B-AROL-O logo.png" /></ac:image> and text after them.</p>
<h2>An image macro quoted inside a code block</h2>
<p>This one is a code sample, not an image, and must survive as written:</p>
<ac:structured-macro ac:name="code" ac:schema-version="1"><ac:parameter ac:name="language">xml</ac:parameter><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[<ac:image><ri:attachment ri:filename="not-really-an-image.png" /></ac:image>]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro>
<h2>A user mention</h2>
<p>Reviewed by <ac:link><ri:user ri:account-id="557058:11112222-3333-4444-5555-666677778888" /></ac:link>.</p>
<h2>A date</h2>
<p><time datetime="2026-08-27" /></p>
<h2>An emoji reaction</h2>
<p><ac:emoticon ac:name="tick" ac:emoji-shortname=":white_check_mark:" ac:emoji-id="2705" ac:emoji-fallback="&#9989;" /> done</p>
<h2>An emoji picked from the picker</h2>
<p><ac:emoticon ac:name="whatsit" ac:emoji-shortname=":spiral_calendar_pad:" ac:emoji-id="1f5d3" ac:emoji-fallback="\uD83D\uDDD3" /> scheduled</p>
